{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0454"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge geography/peoples","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/geography__peoples.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",438],["-","Monaco's"],["+","Indonesia"],["=",3],["-","Indonesia's"],["+","Monaco,"],["=",1],["+","both "],["=",4],["-","white,"],["+","white"],["=",3],["+","differing only in their proportions,, and "],["=",156],["+","Anything placed on the field, from a star to a coat of arms, is a charge. "],["=",2],["+","flag of Europe, adopted by the Council of Europe on 8 December 1955 and taken over by the European Community in 1985, is nothing but charges on blue: a circle of 12 golden stars, a number chosen as a symbol of completeness and unity, which is why it never changed as the Union grew. The "],["=",352],["+","charge | a figure on the field | the 12 stars of the flag of Europe |\n| "],["=",43]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",400],["-","Monaco"],["+","Indonesien"],["=",3],["-","Indonesien"],["+","Monaco,"],["=",1],["-","mit"],["+","beide"],["=",7],["+","und nur in den Proportionen verschieden, "],["=",150],["+","Alles, was auf das Feld gesetzt wird, vom Stern bis zum Wappen, ist eine Figur. Die Europaflagge, am 8. Dezember 1955 vom Europarat angenommen und 1985 von der Europäischen Gemeinschaft übernommen, besteht nur aus Figuren auf Blau: einem Kreis aus 12 goldenen Sternen, eine Zahl, die als Sinnbild der Vollkommenheit und Einheit gewählt wurde und sich deshalb nie mit dem Wachsen der Union verändert hat. "],["=",322],["+","Figur | ein Bild auf dem Feld | die 12 Sterne der Europaflagge |\n| "],["=",39]]}]},
